2. CORE PRODUCT CONCEPT

The product has four fundamental responsibilities:

1. VISUALIZE

Represent the physical HVAC plant as a digital twin.

2. MONITOR

Display live telemetry, equipment state, communication health, alarms and system conditions.

3. ANALYZE

Provide trends, historical data, performance metrics, energy information, diagnostics and event history.

4. CONTROL

Allow authorized users to issue supervisory commands and setpoint changes where the underlying equipment supports them.

The PLC/BMS remains the primary real-time control and safety authority.

The web platform is a supervisory layer, not the replacement for PLC safety logic.

