19. SIMULATION SCENARIOS

Implement configurable simulation scenarios.

At minimum:

Normal

All equipment healthy.

High cooling demand

Room temperature rises and cooling demand increases.

Fan failure

Fan command exists but fan status fails.

Pump failure

Pump loses availability.

High filter differential pressure

Filter DP gradually increases.

Low chilled-water flow

Flow falls below configured threshold.

High supply temperature

Supply air temperature exceeds configured range.

Sensor failure

Sensor reports BAD/UNKNOWN.

Communication failure

Equipment stops reporting.

Stale telemetry

Data timestamp becomes old.

Manual override

Equipment switches from AUTO to MANUAL.

Recovery

Fault clears and equipment returns to normal.

Command failure

Command is sent but physical state does not confirm.

These scenarios are essential for testing the UI and backend.

