63. LOADING STATES

Do not show blank screens while loading.

Use deliberate technical loading states.

Example:

INITIALIZING SYSTEM TELEMETRY
CONNECTING TO DATA SOURCE
SYNCHRONIZING EQUIPMENT STATE

But don't over-animate.

64. EMPTY STATES

Example:

NO ACTIVE ALARMS
NO HISTORICAL DATA
NO COMMANDS AVAILABLE
NO TELEMETRY AVAILABLE

Never show fake content just to fill space.

65. ACCESSIBILITY

