accessible command confirmation

The Stitch cyan focus treatment should be preserved.

66. ENGINEERING PRECISION

Do not round values unnecessarily.

Store engineering precision correctly.

Display precision should be configurable.

Example:

17.83 °C

may be displayed as:

17.8 °C

depending on point configuration.

